    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rũũĩ Rwoimaga Hekarũ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũndũ ũcio nĩanjookirie itoonyero-inĩ rĩa hekarũ, na niĩ ngĩona maaĩ magĩtherũka kuuma rungu rwa hingĩro ya hekarũ, magatherera na mwena wa irathĩro (tondũ hekarũ yarorete mwena wa irathĩro). Maaĩ macio moimaga na kũu rungu rwa mwena wa gũthini wa hekarũ, o mwena ũcio wa gũthini wa kĩgongona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ agĩcooka akĩndwara nja angereirie kĩhingo kĩa mwena wa gathigathini, na agĩĩthiũrũrũkĩria mwena wa nja akĩndwara nginya kĩhingo-inĩ kĩa nyumĩrĩra kĩrĩa kĩangʼetheire mwena wa irathĩro, namo maaĩ macio maathereraga kuuma mwena wa gũthini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rĩrĩa mũndũ ũcio aathiiaga arorete mwena wa irathĩro anyiitĩte rũrigi rwa gũthima na guoko-rĩ, agĩthima mĩkono 1,000,agĩcooka akĩngereria maaĩ-inĩ macio, namo makĩnginya thũngʼwa-inĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ agĩthima mĩkono ĩngĩ ngiri ĩmwe, na akĩnduĩkanĩria maaĩ-inĩ macio, namo makĩnginya maru-inĩ. Agĩcooka agĩthima mĩkono ĩngĩ ngiri ĩmwe, na akĩngereria maaĩ-inĩ macio, namo makĩnginya njohero-inĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ agĩthima mĩkono ĩngĩ ngiri ĩmwe, rũgĩkorwo rũrĩ rũũĩ itangĩahotire kũringa, nĩ ũndũ maaĩ macio maarĩ maiyũru na rũkarika ũndũ rũngĩthambĩrwo, rũgatuĩka rũũĩ rũtangĩringĩka nĩ mũndũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akĩnjũũria atĩrĩ, “Mũrũ wa mũndũ, nĩũrona ũndũ ũyũ?” Hĩndĩ ĩyo akĩĩhũndũra, akĩnjookia nginya hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cia rũũĩ rũu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rĩrĩa ndaakinyire ho, ngĩona mĩtĩ mĩingĩ ĩrĩa yarĩ mĩrĩmo yeerĩ ya rũũĩ rũu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake akĩnjĩĩra atĩrĩ, “Maaĩ maya mathereraga marorete bũrũri ũrĩa ũrĩ mwena wa irathĩro, magaikũrũka nginya Araba,magacooka magathiĩ makeitĩrĩra Iria-inĩ rĩa Cumbĩ. Maarĩkia kwĩitĩrĩra iria-inĩ rĩu, namo maaĩ marĩo makaagĩra.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mĩrumbĩ ya ciũmbe iria irĩ muoyo nĩĩgatũũra muoyo kũrĩa guothe rũũĩ rũu rũgaathereragĩra. Nĩgũkaagĩa thamaki nyingĩ, tondũ maaĩ macio nĩkuo mathereragĩra, magatũma maaĩ macio marĩ na cumbĩ magĩre; nĩ ũndũ ũcio kũrĩa rũũĩ rũu rũthereragĩra, ciũmbe ciothe nĩigatũũra muoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ategi a thamaki makaarũgamaga hũgũrũrũ-inĩ ciaruo; kuuma Eni-Gedi nginya Eni-Egilaimu nĩgũgakorwo na kũndũ gwa gũtambũrũkĩrio wabu. Thamaki igaakorwo irĩ cia mĩthemba mĩingĩ, o ta thamaki cia Iria Rĩrĩa Inene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No matindiri makuo na njabacabi ciakuo itikagĩra; igaatigwo irĩ cia cumbĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mĩtĩ ya matunda ma mĩthemba yothe nĩĩgakũra hũgũrũrũ-inĩ cierĩ cia rũũĩ rũu. Mathangũ mayo matikooma, o na kana mĩtĩ ĩyo yaage gũciara. O mweri nĩĩgaciaraga, tondũ maaĩ moimĩte handũ-harĩa-haamũre magaathereraga nginya kũu ĩrĩ. Maciaro mayo magaatuĩka irio namo mathangũ mayo matuĩke ma kũhonania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mĩhaka ya Bũrũri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwathani Jehova ekuuga ũũ: “Ĩno nĩyo mĩhaka ĩrĩa mũkaarũmĩrĩra mũkĩgaya bũrũri ũcio ũtuĩke igai gatagatĩ-inĩ ka mĩhĩrĩga ĩrĩa ikũmi na ĩĩrĩ ya Isiraeli. Jusufu akaaheo icunjĩ igĩrĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe nĩũkamagayania bũrũri ũcio icunjĩ ciiganaine. Tondũ nĩndehĩtire njoete guoko na igũrũ ngiuga atĩ nĩngaũhe maithe manyu ma tene-rĩ, bũrũri ũyũ nĩũgaatuĩka igai rĩanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ũyũ nĩguo ũgaatuĩka mũhaka wa bũrũri ũcio:\nMũhaka wa mwena wa gathigathini ũkoima Iria Rĩrĩa Inene ũgereire njĩra ya Hethiloni, ũhĩtũkĩre Lebo-Hamathu, nginya Zedadi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ũgerere Berotha na Sibiraimu (kũu mũhaka-inĩ ũrĩa ũrĩ gatagatĩ ka Dameski na Hamathu), ũthiĩ nginya Hazeri-Hatikoni, kũu mũhaka-inĩ wa Haurani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naguo mũhaka ũcio ũtambũrũke kuuma iria-inĩ ũkinye Hazari-Enani, mũhaka-inĩ wa mwena wa gathigathini wa Dameski, naguo mũhaka wa Hamathu ũkorwo ũrĩ mwena wa gathigathini. Ũcio nĩguo ũgaatuĩka mũhaka wa mwena wa gathigathini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naguo mũhaka wa mwena wa irathĩro ũkaagerera gatagatĩ ka Haurani na Dameski, ũtwaranĩte na Rũũĩ rwa Jorodani gatagatĩ ka Gileadi na bũrũri ũcio wa Isiraeli, ũrorete o iria-inĩ rĩa mwena wa irathĩro, ũthiĩ nginya Tamaru. Ũcio nĩguo ũgaatuĩka mũhaka wa mwena wa irathĩro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naguo mũhaka wa mwena wa gũthini ũkoima Tamaru o nginya kũu maaĩ-inĩ ma Meriba-Kadeshi, ũtwarane na Karũũĩ ka Misiri o nginya Iria Rĩrĩa Inene. Ũcio nĩguo ũgaatuĩka mũhaka wa mwena wa gũthini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naguo mũhaka wa mwena wa ithũĩro, Iria Rĩrĩa Inene nĩrĩo rĩgaatuĩka mũhaka, ũthiĩ nginya harĩa hangʼetheire Lebo-Hamathu. Ũcio nĩguo ũgaatuĩka mũhaka wa mwena wa ithũĩro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyuĩ nĩ inyuĩ mũkeegayania bũrũri ũyũ kũringana na mĩhĩrĩga ya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũkaũgayana ũtuĩke igai rĩanyu inyuĩ ene, na rĩa andũ a kũngĩ arĩa matũũraga gatagatĩ-inĩ kanyu na nĩ marĩ na ciana. Nĩmũkamatua ta marĩ andũ a Isiraeli maciarĩirwo bũrũri ũcio; acio makaagaĩrwo igai hamwe na inyuĩ gatagatĩ-inĩ ka mĩhĩrĩga ya Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũhĩrĩga-inĩ o ũrĩa mũndũ angĩkorwo atũũrĩte arĩ mũgeni-rĩ, kũu nĩkuo mũkaamũgaĩra igai rĩake,” ũguo nĩguo Mwathani Jehova ekuuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
